{"id":"rslz6fgwxmwch8msqbpquvac5","title":"关键资源：支撑创新的基础","originalTitle":"Critical Resources: Supplying The Foundations Of Innovation","summary":"到2040年，铜、锂和稀土等关键资源的需求预计将持续增长，因矿产密集型技术和基础设施在全球经济中的整合加深。全球供应链可能无法满足需求，到本世纪30年代中期可能出现高达两位数的缺口，需要近5500亿美元的新投资来填补这些缺口。政府努力多元化供应将为资源提供商创造新机会，尤其是稀土领域。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha"},"links":{"original":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4970172-critical-resources-supplying-foundations-of-innovation?source=feed_all_articles"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T15:45:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T16:02:36.498Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T16:02:36.498Z","category":"macro","tags":["研究报告","大宗商品"],"score":21,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"e3bf1340-4cc4-4cb6-bc6e-1c83aa7385ee","title":"全球关键资源需求激增及供应链缺口预警"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"e3bf1340-4cc4-4cb6-bc6e-1c83aa7385ee","title":"全球关键资源需求激增及供应链缺口预警"}],"topics":[{"slug":"commodities","name":"大宗商品"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fJIjtgzT5TuA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}